> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF)
> SELECT t1.a, s.a FROM a12_t t1 LEFT JOIN a12_t t2 ON t1.a = t2.b
>   JOIN LATERAL (SELECT t1.a AS a UNION ALL SELECT t2.a AS a) s ON true
>   WHERE s.a IS NOT NULL
QUERY PLAN:text
Nested Loop
  ->  Hash Right Join
        Hash Cond: (t2.b = t1.a)
        ->  Seq Scan on a12_t t2
        ->  Hash
              ->  Seq Scan on a12_t t1
  ->  Append
        ->  Result
        ->  Result
              One-Time Filter: (t2.a IS NOT NULL)
